lines+=['','Do not attribute all historical differences to this patch: the KVM restore implementation is unchanged, but its measured time increased ~4 ms. Node execution also regressed. Host round snapshots are retained. This run demonstrates a narrower identity-path improvement, not end-to-end speedup.','', 'Preparation (outside request metric; no interpreter execution):']
